This project contains a portable port of the Mutable Instruments “Grids” drum pattern generator.
The Grids-derived portions of this project are licensed under the GNU General Public License,
version 3 or (at your option) any later version (GPL-3.0-or-later).

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

The full text of the GPL v3 is in COPYING, alongside this file
(also at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html).

A release binary carries NOTICES.txt (written by common/tools/notices.py): the GPL,
and the notices of everything else compiled into it.

Notes:
- This repository also depends on third-party components under their own licenses.
  See the vendored dependency directories under deps/ for those license texts.
